  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 26 Question 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Why does the Holy Spirit need to be the one who gives new life?
  answers:
  - Only the Spirit can give spiritual birth
  - He doesn't
  - Because I said so
  - Who knows
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  discussionAnswer: No amount of human effort could accomplish the new birth. People
    do not have the ability to completely change their own lives and make themselves
    holy. Only God can do that, and in His grade He sends the Spirit to regenerate
    and renew His people.
